; Phase E e4b: _silica_rt_actor_kill_abnormal — set pending exit reason_tag to 1 (abnormal) and stop the actor.
; X0=actor_ref or atom registry key. Returns X0=0 (atom :ok). Used by trials to inject abnormal exits so :transient restart policy
; (restart iff reason_tag != 0) can be exercised. Mutex protects the alive/reason_tag transition vs
; deliver_exit reading [ACB+#336] from the actor's own thread.
